<article class="about">
    <h1>About TheBluesland</h1>
    <p>
        TheBluesland is a hand-curated Spotify library - rooted in blues and rock, grown over time
        to cover the rest of Mehmet's personal collection. Every playlist gets a written curator
        note instead of just a title and a track list, because context is part of the listening
        experience.
    </p>
    <p>
        Browse by mood, genre, occasion or era, or start with one of the
        <a href="/collections">playlist collections</a>. Read the curator note on each playlist
        page, then follow its Spotify link to listen.
    </p>
</article>
